# Components

Read a component with `phemc components <name>`, and its examples with `phemc examples <name>`.

## app

- `Card` A card of the app.

## acme/ui

Guide: `phemc docs acme/ui` (`acme/ui#install`, `acme/ui#naming`)

- `Button` A button.
- `Dialog` A modal dialog. Parts: DialogTrigger, DialogPopup, DialogViewport, DialogTitle.
